        "en": "Aziz has 8 pencils. Said has 2 fewer. How many does Said have?"
      },
      "hint": {
        "uz": "8 dan 2 ni ayir.",
        "ru": "Вычти из 8 число 2.",
        "en": "Take 2 from 8."
      },
      "explanation": {
        "uz": "8 - 2 = 6.",
        "ru": "8 - 2 = 6.",
        "en": "8 - 2 = 6."
